# Stitch MCP Integration Standards

## 1. Overview

[Stitch](https://stitch.googleapis.com) is a Google AI-powered UI design tool accessible via MCP. It allows AI agents to generate, edit, and iterate on UI screens using natural language prompts, and export production-ready frontend code.

This project uses Stitch as the **source of truth for UI design**. All visual design decisions for the portfolio site must be reflected in the Stitch project before being implemented in code.

